# The front door: kernel's routes (repos/kernel/deploy/Caddyfile, unchanged) plus Workbench's API.
#   /api/*   PostgREST (workbench/BRIEF.md section 7); the prefix is stripped, so /api/note is PostgREST's /note
#   the rest kernel: its UI at /ui/ and MCP at /mcp
# With KK_SITE set to a public host name, Caddy gets and renews a certificate, as in kernel's file.
{$KK_SITE::80} {
	encode zstd gzip

	redir /api /api/
	handle_path /api/* {
		reverse_proxy postgrest:3000
	}

	handle {
		reverse_proxy kernel:8000
	}
}
